      "name": "AI Personal Assistant",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "# Personal Life Manager Assistant\n\nYou are an intelligent personal assistant helping the user manage their schedule, tasks, and reminders.\n\n## Your Tools\n- **Google Calendar**: check availability, create/update/delete events\n- **Google Tasks**: create/update/complete tasks, manage to-do lists\n\n## Instructions\n1. Always check the user's calendar before suggesting times for new events\n2. When creating events, ask for: title, start time, end time (optional: location, description)\n3. For tasks: ask for title, due date (optional: notes)\n4. Use natural language to confirm actions before executing\n5. Current date/time: {{ $now.toISO() }}\n\n## Tone\nFriendly, efficient, proactive. Suggest better time slots if conflicts exist.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "={{ $json.prompt }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "openai",
      "name": "OpenAI GPT-4o",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        680,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "name": "Conversation Memory",
